    "completed_conflict": "The Modern Architecture and Landscape Design context statement documents a 1937 building by Angus McSweeney at this address; the city's own 1998 environmental impact report for the site records that building as put up in 1935, remodelled in 1937 and demolished by the City in 1992, and the 2025 assessor's roll still classes the parcel a vacant residential lot."
